{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SlimeCraft is a roguelike crafting game where you take control of a blue slime in a randomly generated world. You must mine objects to gather resources and manage your inventory to prepare for oncoming waves of enemies. Craft barricades and powerful magic items to build your defense, the longer you survive the higher your score. Find treasure, destroy spawners, and discover portals to other worlds as you continue exploring through space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Controls:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move with [WASD]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press [Tab] to access inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hold the [Left Mouse Button] to mine, craft, and attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press [Escape] to quit the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press [R] to restart the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scroll the [Mouse Wheel] to navigate the crafting menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click the\u00a0[Right Mouse Button] to throw items away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press [M] to mute audio and [P] to play audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Hints:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items won't disappear, you can come back for them later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waves of enemies come out each night and a horde of slimes is released on day three.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies can stack on top of each other and deliver a more powerful blow to the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's no point in saving food, heal up as soon as you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies of the night can pass through barricades, slimes can potentially slip through them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure to build an offense, you can't survive with only barricades!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Credits:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by Jeremy Ulrich</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music by trndytrndy</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817050?t=1750803222","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817050/d3df15990eede87c614895cecc5a47c07d5a944c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750803222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817050/1596a25482794d6bb700bc79f21ffde5ccec340c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750803222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817050/1596a25482794d6bb700bc79f21ffde5ccec340c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750803222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SlimeCraft is a roguelike crafting game where you take control of a blue slime in a randomly generated world. You must mine objects to gather resources and manage your inventory to prepare for oncoming waves of enemies. Craft barricades and powerful magic items to build your defense, the longer you survive the higher your score. Find treasure, destroy spawners, and discover portals to other worlds as you continue exploring through space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Controls:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move with [WASD]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press [Tab] to access inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hold the [Left Mouse Button] to mine, craft, and attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press [Escape] to quit the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press [R] to restart the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scroll the [Mouse Wheel] to navigate the crafting menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click the\u00a0[Right Mouse Button] to throw items away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press [M] to mute audio and [P] to play audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Hints:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items won't disappear, you can come back for them later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waves of enemies come out each night and a horde of slimes is released on day three.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies can stack on top of each other and deliver a more powerful blow to the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's no point in saving food, heal up as soon as you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies of the night can pass through barricades, slimes can potentially slip through them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure to build an offense, you can't survive with only barricades!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Credits:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by Jeremy Ulrich</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music by trndytrndy</p>","developers":["Jeremy Ulrich"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817050/6df2e14c65dad47f9ee5896fd4068b78626ef742/header.jpg?t=1750803222","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156813,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156813/movie480.mp4?t=1750460389","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156813/movie_max.mp4?t=1750460389"},"name":"SlimeCraft Gameplay Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156813/13634237f471eacd00735faca1fa788694c90c24/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750460389","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156813/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750460389","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156813/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750460389"}}],"name":"SlimeCraft","package_groups":[],"pc_requi